0..75 Comment "//! Factorial by recursion and by iteration agree, and a factorial is even."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..157 Comment "//! Grégoire and Leroy time factorial on unary naturals, its parity, and two"
158..235 Comment "//! factorial terms with one normal form. The parity reads back one constant,"
236..264 Comment "//! so the run dominates it."
265..268 Comment "//!"
269..335 Comment "//! One path compares the recursive and the iterative factorial of"
336..354 Comment "//! six. The other"
355..401 Comment "//! states that the factorial of five is even."
402..405 Comment "//!"
406..486 Comment "//! - cites: [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction], § 6"
487..525 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
526..529 Comment "//!"
530..703 Comment "//! [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction]: https://doi.org/10.1145/581478.581501 \"Grégoire and Leroy, A compiled implementation of strong reduction\""
